nt and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to sync", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to happen at the same time as something else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My sleep-wake cycle isn't syncing up with my day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hypnosis", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a state similar to sleep, in which someone's thoughts can be influenced by someone else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to try hypnosis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "viable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having the ability to work successfully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is that a viable option?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "insomnia", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an inabilty to sleep", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to get rid of this insomnia. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to consult", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask for information or advice from someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should always consult your doctor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "meditation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the practice of emptying your mind of thoughts and feelings, in order to relax completely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've tried meditation. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "guided imagery ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the practice of using words and music to relax completely", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't think guided imagery works for me. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "aromatherapy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the practice  of using essential oils to relax completely ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I enjoy aromatherapy from time to time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "remedy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a medicine to cure an illness or pain ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should try a natural remedy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Present vs. Present Continuous ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " There are verbs that hardly ever take the continuous. This is because they express states that are permanent and not subject to a frequent change. <br/>Among these verbs we find verbs of the mind: <span class=\"italic\">know</span>, <span class=\"italic\">understand</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hope</span>, <span class=\"italic\">mean</span>, <span class=\"italic\">think</span>.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples: <ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">What do you mean?</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I think I may have a solution to this problem.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I hope he'll refer me to someone.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The<span class=\"italic\"> Present Continuous </span>gives the actions limited duration and  makes them temporary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">I'm running out of options.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing What is Necessary", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal <span class=\"italic\">must</span> or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> ... or <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span> to express what is necessary.</p>  You can also use a superlative adjective when expressing what is necessary. Remember you always use <span class=\"italic\">the</span> with the superlative.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I'm going to have to try meditation. It's the most recommended option.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'd better try acupuncture. It's the best remedy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can use the following to express what is necessary: <ul><li>You had better ...</li> <li>You have got to ...</li> <li>I'm going to have to ...</li> <li>You need to ...</li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. Do some research about insomnia.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find different treatments for insomnia. Write them down.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short report about the treatments you found.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Put them in order from the one you would recommend the most to the one you would recommend the least.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use expressions to say which are necessary and provide a solution.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your report. Give it to a friend to read.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I offer advice and solutions to a problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about what is necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my report with a friend.", "type": "text"}]}]}